# Variables for the local Cloudflare preview (`npm run preview`).
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in real values there. .dev.vars is
# ignored by Git; this example file lists names only and never values.
# No variables are needed yet.

# NEXTJS_ENV picks which .env files the preview loads. The adapter's setup
# tool writes NEXTJS_ENV=development; we leave it out so the local preview
# loads the production env files, the same as the deployed worker.
# Uncomment it to preview with the development env files instead.
# NEXTJS_ENV=development
